_pdbx_database_remark.text   
;
HETEROGEN
THERE IS AN EXTRA ATOM H12 IN MOLECULE 4FP. AUTHOR STATES
THAT THE MOLECULE 4FP IS PROTONATED (CHARGED) UNDER THE
PH CONDITIONS OF THE EXPERIMENT, AND THIS PROTONATION
STATE IS CRITICAL TO THE BINDING MODE OBSERVED.
;
